  "title": "3 November 1965: Recording: Michelle",
  "date": "1965-11-03",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>Studio Two, EMI Studios, Abbey Road<br>\nProducer: <a href=\"/people/george-martin/\">George Martin</a><br>\nEngineer: <a href=\"/people/norman-smith/\">Norman Smith</a></p><p>One of the highlights of the <a href=\"/albums/rubber-soul/\"><em>Rubber Soul</em></a> album, <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a>’s <a href=\"/songs/michelle/\">‘Michelle’</a>, was recorded on this day at Abbey Road. <span id=\"more-4636\"></span></p><p>There were two scheduled sessions, from 2.30-7pm and 7-11.30pm, although the day was effectively one continuous session. During the afternoon the group rehearsed and arranged the rhythm track, which was recorded in a single take onto several tracks of the multi-track tape.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1965/11/03/recording-michelle/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-4636 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/germany_michelle/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"198\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_michelle-200x198.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Michelle single artwork - Germany\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_michelle-200x198.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_michelle-580x574.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_michelle-960x949.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_michelle-768x760.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_michelle-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_michelle.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9435\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/germany_michelle/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_michelle.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,989\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Michelle single artwork – Germany\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/germany_michelle-960x949.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/spain_michelle_ep/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"194\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_michelle_ep-200x194.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Michelle EP artwork - Spain\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_michelle_ep-200x194.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_michelle_ep-580x563.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_michelle_ep-960x931.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_michelle_ep-768x745.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_michelle_ep.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"10083\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/spain_michelle_ep/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_michelle_ep.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,970\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Michelle EP artwork – Spain\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_michelle_ep-960x931.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/japan_michelle_ep/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_michelle_ep-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Michelle EP artwork - Japan\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_michelle_ep-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_michelle_ep-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_michelle_ep-958x960.jpg 958w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_michelle_ep-768x770.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_michelle_ep-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_michelle_ep.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9585\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/japan_michelle_ep/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_michelle_ep.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,1002\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Michelle EP artwork – Japan\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_michelle_ep-958x960.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/brazil_michelle/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"198\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_michelle-200x198.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Michelle single artwork - Brazil\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_michelle-200x198.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_michelle-580x575.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_michelle-960x952.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_michelle-768x762.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_michelle-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_michelle.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9187\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/brazil_michelle/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_michelle.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,992\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Michelle single artwork – Brazil\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_michelle-960x952.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/france_michelle_ep/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"198\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_michelle_ep-200x198.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Michelle EP artwork - France\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_michelle_ep-200x198.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_michelle_ep-580x575.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_michelle_ep-960x951.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_michelle_ep-768x761.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_michelle_ep-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_michelle_ep.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9333\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/france_michelle_ep/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_michelle_ep.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,991\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Michelle EP artwork – France\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_michelle_ep-960x951.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/norway_michelle/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_michelle-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Michelle single artwork - Norway\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_michelle-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_michelle-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_michelle-960x960.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_michelle-768x769.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_michelle-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_michelle.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9850\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/norway_michelle/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_michelle.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,1001\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Michelle single artwork – Norway\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_michelle-960x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><p>The backing track contained McCartney’s Epiphone Texan acoustic guitar, <a href=\"/people/george-harrison/\">George Harrison</a> playing <a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a>’s Framus 12-string acoustic guitar, and <a href=\"/people/ringo-starr/\">Ringo Starr</a>’s drumming. Each of the guitars on the rhythm track was capoed at the fifth fret. The recording was then given a reduction mix to free up extra tracks for overdubs.</p><p><a href=\"/gallery/lyrics/lyrics-michelle_01/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-108847\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMzc4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgODAwIDM3OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"108847\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/lyrics/lyrics-michelle_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-michelle_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1420,671\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"3\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney&amp;#8217;s handwritten lyrics for Michelle\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-michelle_01-960x454.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/lyrics-michelle_01-960x454.jpg\" alt=\"Paul McCartney's handwritten lyrics for Michelle\" width=\"800\" height=\"378\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-108847\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-michelle_01-960x454.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-michelle_01-580x274.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-michelle_01-200x95.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-michelle_01-768x363.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-michelle_01.jpg 1420w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"></a></p><p>In the evening Lennon filled track two with his Ramírez acoustic guitar, on which he played the descending notes in the song’s introduction and transitions, plus a bass guitar part by McCartney, and an electric guitar solo played by Harrison.</p><p>On track three were Lennon, McCartney and Harrison’s harmony vocals, and onto the final track McCartney recorded his lead vocals.</p><blockquote><div>Because it was only on four little tracks, it was very easy to mix. There were no decisions to make, we’d made them all in the writing and in the recording. We would mix them, and it would take half an hour, maybe. Then it would go up on a shelf, in a quarter-inch tape box. And that was it. That was the only thing we ever did to ‘Michelle’.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">Paul McCartney<br>\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/manyyearsfromnow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Many Years From Now</em></a>, Barry Miles</div>\n<!--[googlesitekit-end-of-content]--><div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0 10px 0;\"><strong>Page last updated:</strong> 26 June 2023</div></div></div><div class=\"on-this-day-wrapper\"><h3>Also on this day...</h3><ul><li>2025: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2025/11/03/paul-mccartney-live-state-farm-arena-atlanta-2/\">Paul McCartney live: State Farm Arena, Atlanta</a></li><li>2017: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2017/11/03/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-toyota-music-factory-irving/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Toyota Music Factory, Irving</a></li><li>2005: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2005/11/03/paul-mccartney-live-keyarena-seattle/\">Paul McCartney live: KeyArena, Seattle</a></li><li>2002: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2002/11/03/paul-mccartney-live-palacio-de-los-deportes-mexico-city-2/\">Paul McCartney live: Palacio de los Deportes, Mexico City</a></li><li>1998: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1998/11/03/us-album-release-wonsaponatime-john-lennon/\">US album release: Wonsaponatime by John Lennon</a></li><li>1998: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1998/11/03/us-album-release-john-lennon-anthology/\">US album release: John Lennon Anthology</a></li><li>1989: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1989/11/03/paul-mccartney-live-palacio-de-los-deportes-madrid-2/\">Paul McCartney live: Palacio de los Deportes, Madrid</a></li><li>1989: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1989/11/03/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-kyushu-kousei-nenkin-kaikan-fukuoka/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Kyūshū Kousei Nenkin Kaikan, Fukuoka</a></li><li>1987: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1987/11/03/us-album-release-cloud-nine-george-harrison/\">US album release: Cloud Nine by George Harrison</a></li><li>1986: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1986/11/03/uk-album-release-menlove-ave-john-lennon/\">UK album release: Menlove Ave by John Lennon</a></li><li>1976: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1976/11/03/mixing-wings-over-america-wings-3/\">Mixing: Wings Over America by Wings</a></li><li>1970: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1970/11/03/recording-oh-woman-oh-why-monkberry-moon-delight-paul-linda-mccartney/\">Recording: Oh Woman, Oh Why, Monkberry Moon Delight by Paul and Linda McCartney</a></li><li>1967: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1967/11/03/filming-magical-mystery-tour-17/\">Filming: Magical Mystery Tour</a></li><li>1963: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1963/11/03/live-odeon-cinema-leeds-2/\">The Beatles live: Odeon Cinema, Leeds</a></li><li>1962: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1962/11/03/live-star-club-hamburg-51/\">The Beatles live: Star-Club, Hamburg</a></li><li>1961: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1961/11/03/live-cavern-club-liverpool-71/\">The Beatles live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (lunchtime)</a></li><li>1960: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1960/11/03/live-kaiserkeller-hamburg-31/\">The Beatles live: Kaiserkeller, Hamburg</a></li></ul><p>Want more? Visit the <a title=\"Day after day: the Beatles' history\" href=\"/history/\">Beatles history section</a>.</p></div><div class=\"gm-map\" style=\"position: relative;height: 390px; width: 100%;\"><iframe data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"about:blank\" name=\"gm-map-1\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/?geo_mashup_content=render-map&amp;map_data_key=aabd4a2386dd818d171a38d2fb484472&amp;height=390&amp;width=100%&amp;add_overview_control=false&amp;zoom=16&amp;enable_street_view=false&amp;map_type=G_HYBRID_MAP&amp;name=gm-map-1&amp;object_id=4636&amp;map_content=single\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none; overflow: hidden;\" title=\"Geo Mashup Map\"></iframe></div>",
  "textContent": "Studio Two, EMI Studios, Abbey Road\nProducer: George Martin\nEngineer: Norman SmithOne of the highlights of the Rubber Soul album, Paul McCartney’s ‘Michelle’, was recorded on this day at Abbey Road. There were two scheduled sessions, from 2.30-7pm and 7-11.30pm, although the day was effectively one continuous session. During the afternoon the group rehearsed and arranged the rhythm track, which was recorded in a single take onto several tracks of the multi-track tape.\n\n\n\n\n\nThe backing track contained McCartney’s Epiphone Texan acoustic guitar, George Harrison playing John Lennon’s Framus 12-string acoustic guitar, and Ringo Starr’s drumming. Each of the guitars on the rhythm track was capoed at the fifth fret. The recording was then given a reduction mix to free up extra tracks for overdubs.In the evening Lennon filled track two with his Ramírez acoustic guitar, on which he played the descending notes in the song’s introduction and transitions, plus a bass guitar part by McCartney, and an electric guitar solo played by Harrison.On track three were Lennon, McCartney and Harrison’s harmony vocals, and onto the final track McCartney recorded his lead vocals.Because it was only on four little tracks, it was very easy to mix. There were no decisions to make, we’d made them all in the writing and in the recording. We would mix them, and it would take half an hour, maybe. Then it would go up on a shelf, in a quarter-inch tape box. And that was it. That was the only thing we ever did to ‘Michelle’.Paul McCartney\nMany Years From Now, Barry Miles\nPage last updated: 26 June 2023Also on this day...2025: Paul McCartney live: State Farm Arena, Atlanta2017: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Toyota Music Factory, Irving2005: Paul McCartney live: KeyArena, Seattle2002: Paul McCartney live: Palacio de los Deportes, Mexico City1998: US album release: Wonsaponatime by John Lennon1998: US album release: John Lennon Anthology1989: Paul McCartney live: Palacio de los Deportes, Madrid1989: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Kyūshū Kousei Nenkin Kaikan, Fukuoka1987: US album release: Cloud Nine by George Harrison1986: UK album release: Menlove Ave by John Lennon1976: Mixing: Wings Over America by Wings1970: Recording: Oh Woman, Oh Why, Monkberry Moon Delight by Paul and Linda McCartney1967: Filming: Magical Mystery Tour1963: The Beatles live: Odeon Cinema, Leeds1962: The Beatles live: Star-Club, Hamburg1961: The Beatles live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (lunchtime)1960: The Beatles live: Kaiserkeller, HamburgWant more? Visit the Beatles history section.",
